IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-11`

-- Tests of P2-art-11.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Art 11 test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Art 11 test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 11 test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Art 11 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Article 11(1): the technical documentation`

-- Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system placed earlier` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test Section B products facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test Section B products facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13): the application of Articles 9 to 15 may be limited where Section A legislation gives equivalent protection and the overall level is not reduced
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test Section A equivalent facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13)(b) fails (the limitation would reduce the overall level of protection): the requirement applies in full
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system is not limited
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test Section A equivalent facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- drawn up before the placing on the market (2 December 2027) and kept up to date
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- drawn up the day before the placing on the market
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- drawn up on the day of the placing on the market: not before it
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 2 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- drawn up after the placing on the market
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 3 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not kept up to date
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) first subparagraph the technical documentation is drawn up before the placing on the market and kept up to date` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 11 test the Annex I system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system placed earlier` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate that the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements set out in this Section
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
