#ASSERT `Art 11(1) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation is drawn up in such a way as to demonstrate compliance and to inform` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

