§ `Article 11(1), second subparagraph: the simplified manner, the form, the SME and SMC liberty`

-- Art 11(1) as enacted the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- outside the scope of the text: the provider is an SME, including a start-up is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as enacted the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner
-- an SME, including a start-up
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an SMC
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither an SME nor an SMC
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) as amended the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
