#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 11 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
