-- an SME, including a start-up
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an SMC (as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 11(1) the provider may provide the elements of the technical documentation in a simplified manner` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
