§ `Article 11(3): delegated acts amending Annex IV`

-- Art 11(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex IV
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 11(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex IV` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: amending Annex IV is necessary to ensure that, in light of technical progress, the technical documentation provides all the information necessary to assess the compliance of the system with the requirements set out in this Section
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Art 11(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex IV` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING; the gate "where necessary" is a "where" condition, so the Guide's periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (b), gives JUST FALSE when it fails, and the brief's ruling of 2026-11-12, limit (3), leaves a "may" gated by "where" to the Guide's rulings; the first pass had taken limit (1) and answered NOTHING; the facts do not change
#ASSERT `Art 11(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex IV` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the delegated act is adopted in accordance with Article 97
#ASSERT `Art 11(3) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex IV` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Regulative rules of Article 11`

-- an SME that opted and used the form
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the SME's or SMC's duty to use the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 11(1) use the simplified technical documentation form referred to in the paragraph` AT 20
-- an SME that opted and has not yet used the form: the duty stays open; a late act would still read FULFILLED, so no trace reaches BREACH
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the SME's or SMC's duty to use the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- the provider did not opt for the simplified manner: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the SME's or SMC's duty to use the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

-- the form was provided and accepted
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the notified body's duty to accept the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Notified body` DOES `Art 11(1) accept the simplified technical documentation form for the purposes of the conformity assessment` AT 20
-- the form was provided and not yet accepted: the duty stays open (no time limit, no consequence: no breach path)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the notified body's duty to accept the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- the documentation is not on that form: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the notified body's duty to accept the form` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 11 test the Annex III system` `Art 11 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

-- Art 11(1) the Commission's duty to establish the simplified technical documentation form (a rule with no time limit and no consequence: no breach path)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the Commission's duty to establish the simplified technical documentation form` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Commission DOES `Art 11(1) establish a simplified technical documentation form` AT 100
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL (not yet established; a late act would still read FULFILLED)
#TRACE `Art 11(1) the Commission's duty to establish the simplified technical documentation form` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
